      "rationale": "Independent raw verification confirms the exact current installed6144-byte native entry and7 source/mirror/cache resource hashes, one continuous actual0.147.0 gpt-5.6-sol/low UUID and2 COMPLETE transports. The original declined bulk read and initially truncated actual outer return remain preserved. Initial framework rawCLI stdout alone is insufficient; subsequent same-UUID actual tool responses cover source physical lines0–39,40–79,80–119,120 onward. Interaction segments0–49,50–99,100 onward likewise prove complete actual coverage. T2 material has a successful whole actual tool response. No count-only command or model self-report substitutes for full reading, and no writer/inputs/raw/grade is changed by review.",
